# Stock Monitor → Orders tab: orders are grouped by stock with a line per order, and the tab has
# its own sort (Nearest → Expires → Symbol), remembered apart from the list sort. Places two limit
# buys far below the price (they never fill) and cancels them; the player's monitor settings are
# remembered and put back.
name Stock Monitor Orders tab: a line per order under its stock, and its own sort
monitor remember
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 3
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
close-dialog
monitor open
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
monitor-sort Price
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-Orders
wait 1.2
# the tab counts the open orders; the row lists them
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-Orders Orders (
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-Oil
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrders-Oil
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrderType-$order BUY · Limit
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrderDetail-$order 3 shares at or below ₡1 ·
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrderDetail-$order days left
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrderDistance-$order away ·
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-Oil
capture monitor-orders-tab
# its own sort cycle
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Nearest
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
wait 1.2
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Expires
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
wait 1.2
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Symbol
# the list tabs keep their sort, and coming back finds this one as it was left
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
wait 1.2
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Price
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrders-Oil
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-Orders
wait 1.2
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Symbol
# compact rows: one line per order, nothing cut off
monitor-compact on
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorOrderDetail-$order BUY ≤ ₡1 · 3 shares ·
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-Oil
capture monitor-orders-tab-compact
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
close-dialog
monitor restore
